  "releaseNotes": "Breaking: CLI restructured to subcommand style (commit, checkout, pr, azure-devops)\n      New: Running yitpush with no args shows help, like traditional CLI tools\n      New: yitpush commit replaces the default flag-based commit flow\n      New: yitpush checkout replaces --check flag\n      New: yitpush pr replaces --pr-description flag\n      Fix: Windows support for Azure CLI - automatically uses cmd.exe /c az to find az.cmd\n      Fix: Azure DevOps organization fallback - prompts for manual entry when auto-detection fails",
